OL,4,CMan guilty of terror attack plot at    
OL,5,Cmigrant hotel                          
OL,6,GAn alleged white supremist has been    
OL,7,Gfound guilty of plotting to firebomb a 
OL,8,Gmigrant hotel in Hull and possessing   
OL,9,Gweapons for terrorist purposes.        
OL,11,FMikka Lee Anderson, 24, of Morpeth     
OL,12,FStreet, Hull, had planned to attack    
OL,13,Fthe Royal Hotel using petrol bombs, a  
OL,14,Fjury at Newcastle Crown Court was told.
OL,16,FHe was arrested after meeting a would- 
OL,17,Fbe accomplice in February who later    
OL,18,Freported him to police.                
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
